    grafana[Grafana]
    java -->|OTLP traces| alloy
    node -->|OTLP traces| alloy
    java & node & others -->|stdout JSON| alloy
    alloy --> tempo
    alloy --> loki
    java & others & kx -->|scrape| prom
    prom --> am
    tempo & loki & prom --> grafana
